{"t":"005490.KS","n":"POSCO Holdings Inc.","nKo":"포스코홀딩스","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":255500.0,"chg":13000.0,"chgPct":0.05361,"prev":242500.0,"dayH":257500.0,"dayL":245000.0,"w52H":542000.0,"w52L":239500.0,"vol":219572,"avgVol":192829,"mcap":19321107513344,"pe":null,"fpe":9.33,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":8000.0,"divY":0.033,"beta":1.67,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Basic Materials","sKo":"기초재료","i":"Steel","iKo":"강철","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.posco-inc.com","sum":"POSCO Holdings Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an integrated steel producer in Korea and internationally. It operates through six segments: Steel, Trading, Construction, Logistics and Others, Green Materials and Energy, and Others. The company engages in the production, import, sale, and export of steel products, such as hot and cold rolled steel, stainless steel, plates, wire rods, and silicon steel sheets, as well as pig iron, billets, blooms, and slabs; trading of steel and raw materials, textiles, agricultural commodities, and other goods; natural resources development and power generation activities; and planning, designing, and construction of industrial plants, civil engineering projects, and commercial and residential buildings. It is also involved in the manufact","sumKo":"포스코홀딩스는 자회사들과 함께 국내외에서 종합 철강 생산업체로 활동하고 있습니다. 철강, 무역, 건설, 물류 및 기타, 친환경 소재 및 에너지, 기타 등 6개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 열연, 냉연강판, 스테인리스강, 후판, 선재, 규소강판 등의 철강제품과 선철, 빌렛, 블룸, 슬래브 등의 철강제품을 생산, 수입, 판매, 수출하는 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 철강 및 원자재, 직물, 농산물 및 기타 상품의 거래; 천연자원 개발 및 발전 활동; 산업 플랜트, 토목 공학 프로젝트, 상업용 및 주거용 건물의 계획, 설계 및 건설. 제작에도 참여"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":84750203700000,"ni":3560000000000},{"y":2023,"rev":77127197110000,"ni":1698092000000},{"y":2024,"rev":37556000000000,"ni":1090000000000},{"y":2025,"rev":69090000000000,"ni":660000000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":8299000000000,"ni":-223010000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":178761060000